# Coast Collection

- Brand copy, nav, social URLs, hero, collage, and products live only in `src/content/`. Parse with Zod at import. Types come from `z.infer` — do not add a parallel interface.
- Components and pages import `@/content`. Never hardcode bag names, image paths, Instagram/TikTok URLs, or announcement text in JSX.
- Do not commit `*.mov`, `/raw/`, or Cursor `assets/` dumps. Runtime images: `public/bags/`, `public/apparel/`, `public/collage/`, `public/hero/`.
- Search lists catalog matches. Product pages and the cart drawer are real (cart stays in the browser). Account is `/account`: Clerk proves the email, and Stripe holds the shipping address and paid orders. Checkout is a server route to Stripe hosted Checkout; prices come from the catalog. Copy still from `src/content/`.
- Prefer Server Components. Do not add `"use client"` unless the file needs browser APIs or event handlers.
- New Julia videos → `raw/feedback/` + skill `apply-julia-feedback`. Ship via skill `ship-to-main`.
